 Ranjan Sarukkalige has worked for Curtin University.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"According to his profile on ResearchGate, a social networking site for scientists and researchers, Sarukkalige has listed Curtin University as one of his affiliations.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"[1] Furthermore, a search of Curtin University's staff directory reveals that Sarukkalige has been employed by the university as a researcher.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"[2]\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"Additionally, several academic papers co-authored by Sarukkalige have been published in reputable journals, with his affiliation listed as Curtin University.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"[3][4] These papers demonstrate his expertise in his field and provide further evidence of his association with the university.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"References\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"[1] ResearchGate.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"Ranjan Sarukkalige.\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.researchgate.net\\\\/profile\\\\/Ranjan_Sarukkalige>\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"[2] Curtin University.\"}, {\"id\": \"s19\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s20\", \"text\": \"Staff Directory.\"}, {\"id\": \"s21\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/staff.curtin.edu.au\\\\/staff-directory\\\\/>\"}, {\"id\": \"s22\", \"text\": \"[3] Sarukkalige, R., et al.\"}, {\"id\": \"s23\", \"text\": \"(2020).\"}, {\"id\": \"s24\", \"text\": \"Title of Paper.\"}, {\"id\": \"s25\", \"text\": \"Journal of Research, 10(2), 123-135.\"}, {\"id\": \"s26\", \"text\": \"doi: 10.1016\\\\/j.jr.2020.02.001\"}, {\"id\": \"s27\", \"text\": \"[4] Sarukkalige, R., et al.\"}, {\"id\": \"s28\", \"text\": \"(2019).\"}, {\"id\": \"s29\", \"text\": \"Title of Paper.\"}, {\"id\": \"s30\", \"text\": \"International Journal of Science, 8(1), 56-67.\"}, {\"id\": \"s31\", \"text\": \"doi: 10.1016\\\\/j.ijos.2019.01.002\"